      "updated": 1782363506398,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "for (2, 3) and (2,2) we are checking\nthe NS connection. if NS = 1,1 there\nis wall E if NS = 0,0\nthere is no wall E",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "for (2, 3) and (2,2) we are checking\nthe NS connection. if NS = 1,1 there\nis wall E if NS = 0,0\nthere is no wall E",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
